ot folder to get rid of warnings related to missing or unused references. It's probably a bit of a hack, tbh. A lot of online help forums suggest deleting the .godot folder to clear the cache. Having an option in the editor makes it that much easier.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5249799619/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]